<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY  21/22.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY  21/22.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>21/22. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 21/22	 May 20/21</p>
<p> CZK	0.44497	   0.44341</p>
<p> DKK	2.10052	   2.10154</p>
<p> FIM	2.6535	    2.65508</p>
<p> HUF	0.07485	   0.07497</p>
<p> JPY	0.11849	   0.11937</p>
<p> LTL	3.3779	    3.3902</p>
<p> LVL     23.86998	  23.95266</p>
<p> RUR	0.00235	   0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.79836	   1.78781</p>
<p> UAH	7.28192	   7.34107</p>
<p> USD     13.5116	   13.5608</p>
<p> XEU     15.62549	  15.6295</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
